{"id":"Fw0rdSHzWFY","title":"Theme 1. Greeting - Good morning. Good bye. | ESL Song & Story - Learning English for Kids","speaker":"English Singsing","channel":"Kids","level":"A1","duration":"07:15","views":"9.7M","emoji":"👶","color":"linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a, #fee140)","zh":"【English Singsing】主題 1. 問候語 - 早安。再見。 | ESL 歌曲與故事 - 兒童英語學習（精選雙語跟讀教材）","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fw0rdSHzWFY","cues":[{"start":3.96,"duration":13.58,"text":"Theme 1 Greeting Good morning.","en":"Theme 1 Greeting Good morning.","zh":"主題 1 問候語早安。"},{"start":18.52,"duration":1.4,"text":"Good morning, everyone.","en":"Good morning, everyone.","zh":"大家早安。"},{"start":21.04,"duration":1.04,"text":"How are you?","en":"How are you?","zh":"你好嗎？"},{"start":23.24,"duration":2.04,"text":"Fine, thanks. How are you?","en":"Fine, thanks. How are you?","zh":"很好，謝謝。你好嗎？"},{"start":26.5,"duration":0.88,"text":"Great!","en":"Great!","zh":"偉大的！"},{"start":28.3,"duration":1.12,"text":"Come in, please.","en":"Come in, please.","zh":"請進來。"},{"start":32.46,"duration":1.28,"text":"Nice to meet you.","en":"Nice to meet you.","zh":"很高興見到你。"},{"start":34.68,"duration":1.48,"text":"My name is Kate.","en":"My name is Kate.","zh":"我叫凱特。"},{"start":37.5,"duration":1.82,"text":"Nice to meet you, too.","en":"Nice to meet you, too.","zh":"我也很高興見到你。"},{"start":42.12,"duration":1.42,"text":"Sit down, please.","en":"Sit down, please.","zh":"請坐。"},{"start":44.26,"duration":0.76,"text":"Thank you.","en":"Thank you.","zh":"謝謝。"},{"start":62.98,"duration":1.28,"text":"This is the music room.","en":"This is the music room.","zh":"這是音樂室。"},{"start":66.8,"duration":2.46,"text":"Wow! They are good.","en":"Wow! They are good.","zh":"哇！他們很好。"},{"start":78.4,"duration":2.06,"text":"That's the school library.","en":"That's the school library.","zh":"那是學校圖書館。"},{"start":84.08,"duration":2.26,"text":"Wow! Many books!","en":"Wow! Many books!","zh":"哇！很多書！"},{"start":89.36,"duration":1.84,"text":"Good afternoon, everyone.","en":"Good afternoon, everyone.","zh":"大家下午好。"},{"start":91.74,"duration":1.8,"text":"Good afternoon, Mr. Kim.","en":"Good afternoon, Mr. Kim.","zh":"下午好，金先生。"},{"start":96.54,"duration":2.7,"text":"My name is Kate. How are you?","en":"My name is Kate. How are you?","zh":"我叫凱特。你好嗎？"},{"start":100.52,"duration":3.18,"text":"I'm great. Nice to meet you, Kate.","en":"I'm great. Nice to meet you, Kate.","zh":"我很棒。很高興認識你，凱特。"},{"start":117.68,"duration":3.1,"text":"Good morning. Good morning.","en":"Good morning. Good morning.","zh":"早安.早安."},{"start":121.28,"duration":3.4,"text":"This is Jiho. This is Bomi.","en":"This is Jiho. This is Bomi.","zh":"這是吉浩。這就是波密。"},{"start":124.88,"duration":3.04,"text":"Good morning, Jiho.","en":"Good morning, Jiho.","zh":"早上好，吉浩。"},{"start":128.5,"duration":2.8,"text":"Good morning, Bomi.","en":"Good morning, Bomi.","zh":"早上好，波密。"},{"start":135.68,"duration":3.24,"text":"Good afternoon. Good afternoon.","en":"Good afternoon. Good afternoon.","zh":"午安.午安."},{"start":139.36,"duration":3.36,"text":"This is Wiz. This is Wiki.","en":"This is Wiz. This is Wiki.","zh":"這是維茲。這是維基。"},{"start":142.92,"duration":3.16,"text":"Good afternoon, Wiz.","en":"Good afternoon, Wiz.","zh":"下午好，維茲。"},{"start":146.56,"duration":3.04,"text":"Good afternoon, Wiki.","en":"Good afternoon, Wiki.","zh":"下午好，維基。"},{"start":163.04,"duration":1.98,"text":"Good morning. Good morning.","en":"Good morning. Good morning.","zh":"早安.早安."},{"start":165.16,"duration":1.94,"text":"Good morning. How are you?","en":"Good morning. How are you?","zh":"早安.你好嗎？"},{"start":167.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"I'm fine. I'm fine.","en":"I'm fine. I'm fine.","zh":"我很好。我很好。"},{"start":169.3,"duration":2.16,"text":"I'm fine. Thank you.","en":"I'm fine. Thank you.","zh":"我很好。謝謝。"},{"start":171.56,"duration":2.24,"text":"Good afternoon. Good afternoon.","en":"Good afternoon. Good afternoon.","zh":"午安.午安."},{"start":173.92,"duration":1.92,"text":"Good afternoon. How are you?","en":"Good afternoon. How are you?","zh":"午安.你好嗎？"},{"start":175.9,"duration":2.22,"text":"I'm not good. I'm not good.","en":"I'm not good. I'm not good.","zh":"我不好。我不好。"},{"start":178.28,"duration":2.02,"text":"I'm not good. Oh, no.","en":"I'm not good. Oh, no.","zh":"我不好。哦，不。"},{"start":184.86,"duration":2.08,"text":"Good evening. Good evening.","en":"Good evening. Good evening.","zh":"晚安.晚安."},{"start":187.0,"duration":2.06,"text":"Good evening. How are you?","en":"Good evening. How are you?","zh":"晚安.你好嗎？"},{"start":189.16,"duration":1.92,"text":"I'm great. I'm great.","en":"I'm great. I'm great.","zh":"我很棒。我很棒。"},{"start":191.16,"duration":2.18,"text":"I'm great. Thank you.","en":"I'm great. Thank you.","zh":"我很棒。謝謝。"},{"start":207.06,"duration":3.28,"text":"Good morning, morning.","en":"Good morning, morning.","zh":"早安，早安。"},{"start":210.64,"duration":3.94,"text":"Good afternoon, afternoon.","en":"Good afternoon, afternoon.","zh":"下午好，下午好。"},{"start":214.64,"duration":3.78,"text":"Good evening, evening.","en":"Good evening, evening.","zh":"晚上好，晚上好。"},{"start":218.62,"duration":3.8,"text":"This is Jiho. This is Bomi.","en":"This is Jiho. This is Bomi.","zh":"這是吉浩。這就是波密。"},{"start":232.6,"duration":1.88,"text":"Good morning, Toto.","en":"Good morning, Toto.","zh":"早安，託託。"},{"start":235.1,"duration":1.5,"text":"Good morning, Bunny.","en":"Good morning, Bunny.","zh":"早上好，兔子。"},{"start":247.68,"duration":1.2,"text":"Okay.","en":"Okay.","zh":"好的。"},{"start":256.46,"duration":1.9,"text":"Hi, I'm Kiki.","en":"Hi, I'm Kiki.","zh":"嗨，我是琪琪。"},{"start":259.08,"duration":2.9,"text":"Hello, Kiki. I'm Toto.","en":"Hello, Kiki. I'm Toto.","zh":"你好，琪琪。我是託託。"},{"start":263.54,"duration":3.48,"text":"Good morning, Foxy. This is Toto.","en":"Good morning, Foxy. This is Toto.","zh":"早安，狐狸。這是託託。"},{"start":267.56,"duration":2.74,"text":"Hello, Toto. I'm Foxy.","en":"Hello, Toto. I'm Foxy.","zh":"你好，託託。我是小狐狸"},{"start":279.12,"duration":1.14,"text":"This is Bunny.","en":"This is Bunny.","zh":"這是兔子。"},{"start":281.36,"duration":1.62,"text":"Good afternoon, Bunny.","en":"Good afternoon, Bunny.","zh":"下午好，兔子。"},{"start":285.22,"duration":1.16,"text":"Good afternoon.","en":"Good afternoon.","zh":"午安."},{"start":296.18,"duration":1.06,"text":"Good evening.","en":"Good evening.","zh":"晚上好。"},{"start":297.8,"duration":1.52,"text":"Good evening.","en":"Good evening.","zh":"晚上好。"},{"start":299.62,"duration":1.06,"text":"Good bye.","en":"Good bye.","zh":"再見。"},{"start":301.22,"duration":0.78,"text":"Bye.","en":"Bye.","zh":"再見。"},{"start":318.46,"duration":2.52,"text":"Good morning! Nice to meet you.","en":"Good morning! Nice to meet you.","zh":"早安!很高興見到你。"},{"start":322.08,"duration":1.36,"text":"Nice to meet you.","en":"Nice to meet you.","zh":"很高興見到你。"},{"start":324.48,"duration":0.92,"text":"How are you?","en":"How are you?","zh":"你好嗎？"},{"start":329.12,"duration":3.72,"text":"Um... I'm Okay. How are you?","en":"Um... I'm Okay. How are you?","zh":"嗯……我沒事。你好嗎？"},{"start":334.12,"duration":1.78,"text":"Fine, thank you.","en":"Fine, thank you.","zh":"好的，謝謝。"},{"start":337.26,"duration":0.9,"text":"Hahaha.","en":"Hahaha.","zh":"哈哈哈。"},{"start":340.0,"duration":1.08,"text":"Let's go!","en":"Let's go!","zh":"我們走吧！"},{"start":347.48,"duration":2.48,"text":"Good afternoon! How are you?","en":"Good afternoon! How are you?","zh":"午安!你好嗎？"},{"start":351.52,"duration":0.86,"text":"Not good!","en":"Not good!","zh":"不好！"},{"start":360.1,"duration":0.78,"text":"Thank you!","en":"Thank you!","zh":"謝謝你！"},{"start":362.02,"duration":1.24,"text":"Are you okay?","en":"Are you okay?","zh":"你還好嗎？"},{"start":365.08,"duration":1.96,"text":"Hahaha! I'm great.","en":"Hahaha! I'm great.","zh":"哈哈哈！我很棒。"},{"start":371.32,"duration":1.2,"text":"Let's go!","en":"Let's go!","zh":"我們走吧！"},{"start":379.3,"duration":1.38,"text":"Are you okay?","en":"Are you okay?","zh":"你還好嗎？"},{"start":383.46,"duration":3.92,"text":"I'm not okay! I'm not happy!","en":"I'm not okay! I'm not happy!","zh":"我不好！我不高興！"},{"start":392.38,"duration":1.44,"text":"Oh no...","en":"Oh no...","zh":"哦不..."},{"start":398.12,"duration":1.44,"text":"Good evening, everyone!","en":"Good evening, everyone!","zh":"大家晚上好！"},{"start":401.22,"duration":1.06,"text":"Who are you?","en":"Who are you?","zh":"你是誰？"},{"start":405.32,"duration":1.62,"text":"Oh, no!","en":"Oh, no!","zh":"哦，不！"},{"start":410.44,"duration":1.02,"text":"It's a lion!","en":"It's a lion!","zh":"這是一頭獅子！"},{"start":416.76,"duration":2.56,"text":"Wow, you are a great lion!","en":"Wow, you are a great lion!","zh":"哇，你真是一頭偉大的獅子！"},{"start":421.22,"duration":0.98,"text":"Thank you!","en":"Thank you!","zh":"謝謝你！"},{"start":423.26,"duration":2.5,"text":"Now, let's go to OZ!","en":"Now, let's go to OZ!","zh":"現在，我們去奧茲吧！"}],"words":[]}